{"work":"abhidhamma","version":"abh-pli","book":"pp","chapter":2,"title":"2. Dukauddesa","note":"Pāli only: every English translation of the Abhidhamma is still under copyright, so no English can be shown yet. A free translation will be added if one becomes available.","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"Dve puggalā—"},
{"v":"2","t":"Kodhano ca, upanāhī ca."},
{"v":"3","t":"Makkhī ca, paḷāsī ca."},
{"v":"4","t":"Issukī ca, maccharī ca."},
{"v":"5","t":"Saṭho ca, māyāvī ca."},
{"v":"6","t":"Ahiriko ca, anottappī ca."},
{"v":"7","t":"Dubbaco ca, pāpamitto ca."},
{"v":"8","t":"Indriyesu aguttadvāro ca, bhojane amattaññū ca."},
{"v":"9","t":"Muṭṭhassati ca, asampajāno ca."},
{"v":"10","t":"Sīlavipanno ca, diṭṭhivipanno ca."},
{"v":"11","t":"Ajjhattasaṁyojano ca, bahiddhāsaṁyojano ca."},
{"v":"12","t":"Akkodhano ca, anupanāhī ca."},
{"v":"13","t":"Amakkhī ca, apaḷāsī ca."},
{"v":"14","t":"Anissukī ca, amaccharī ca."},
{"v":"15","t":"Asaṭho ca, amāyāvī ca."},
{"v":"16","t":"Hirimā ca, ottappī ca."},
{"v":"17","t":"Suvaco ca, kalyāṇamitto ca."},
{"v":"18","t":"Indriyesu guttadvāro ca, bhojane mattaññū ca."},
{"v":"19","t":"Upaṭṭhitassati ca, sampajāno ca."},
{"v":"20","t":"Sīlasampanno ca, diṭṭhisampanno ca."},
{"v":"21","t":"Dve puggalā dullabhā lokasmiṁ."},
{"v":"22","t":"Dve puggalā duttappayā."},
{"v":"23","t":"Dve puggalā sutappayā."},
{"v":"24","t":"Dvinnaṁ puggalānaṁ āsavā vaḍḍhanti."},
{"v":"25","t":"Dvinnaṁ puggalānaṁ āsavā na vaḍḍhanti."},
{"v":"26","t":"Hīnādhimutto ca, paṇītādhimutto ca."},
{"v":"27","t":"Titto ca, tappetā ca."},
{"v":"28","t":"Dukaṁ."}
]}
